     "tests": ["refusals::refuses_when_the_landlock_abi_is_too_old", "real_kernel::real_refusal_when_the_landlock_abi_is_too_old"]},
    {"id": "F-FC08", "claim": "Ignore a Landlock ruleset that cannot be applied.",
